{"id":"a6e0a08f9363d0ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-rapidly-decreasing.md","title":"Rapidly Decreasing","display":"df-rapidly-decreasing — Rapidly Decreasing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rapidly-decreasing","aliases":["58-df-rapidly-decreasing","Rapidly Decreasing"],"display":"df-rapidly-decreasing — Rapidly Decreasing","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rapidly-decreasing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rapidly-decreasing</span><span>Rapidly Decreasing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rapidly-decreasing — Rapidly Decreasing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: \\mathbb{R}^n \\to \\mathbb{C}\">\\(f: \\mathbb{R}^n \\to \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (smooth function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{S}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\\)</span> (Schwartz-space parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S,\\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S,\\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha\\partial^\\beta f(x)|&lt;\\infty\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha\\partial^\\beta f(x)|&lt;\\infty\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S(\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n),n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)=\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\mid\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S(\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n),n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)=\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\mid\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file now supplies the upstream rapidly-decreasing predicate used by the canonical Schwartz-space atom, breaking the former circular dependency.</li>\n<li>Density in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> and Fourier invariance are downstream theorems and have been removed from the definition.</li>\n<li>Fourier transform: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}\\)</span> bijective; Plancherel extends to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span></li>\n<li>Tempered: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{S}&#39;\\)</span> dual = tempered distributions; contains polynomially bounded functions</li>\n<li>Modulation spaces: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{p,q}\">\\(M^{p,q}\\)</span> with phase-space localization; generalize <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}\">\\(\\mathcal{S}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stein and Shakarchi, Fourier Analysis</li>\n<li>Grafakos, Classical Fourier Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f: \\mathbb{R}^n \\to \\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}(\\mathbb{R}^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S,\\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha\\partial^\\beta f(x)|<\\infty\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rapidly\\text{-}decreasing} \\vdash \\mathrm{SchwartzSpace}_S(\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n),n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)=\\{f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb C)\\mid\\mathrm{RapidlyDecreasing}_S(f,n)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}'","display":false},{"tex":"M^{p,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{S}","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1039","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-rapidly-decreasing.md|58-df-rapidly-decreasing]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}